8,buffer.bytesPerLine(),space,kCGImageAlphaPremultipliedFirst|kCGBitmapByteOrder32Little);CGColorSpaceRelease(space);if(context){CGContextDrawImage(context,CGRectMake(0,0,buffer.width(),buffer.height()),image);CGContextRelease(context);}CGImageRelease(image);return context?analyzeSurface(r,buffer):missing;}}
};
QRect axBounds(AXUIElementRef window){CFTypeRef p=nullptr,s=nullptr;CGPoint point{};CGSize size{};bool ok=AXUIElementCopyAttributeValue(window,kAXPositionAttribute,&p)==kAXErrorSuccess&&AXUIElementCopyAttributeValue(window,kAXSizeAttribute,&s)==kAXErrorSuccess;if(ok){AXValueGetValue(static_cast<AXValueRef>(p),kAXValueCGPointType,&point);AXValueGetValue(static_cast<AXValueRef>(s),kAXValueCGSizeType,&size);}if(p)CFRelease(p);if(s)CFRelease(s);return ok?QRect(qRound(point.x),qRound(point.y),qRound(size.width),qRound(size.height)):QRect();}
}
struct MacPlatform::Native {
    NSWindow* window=nil;NSVisualEffectView* effect=nil;AXUIElementRef target=nullptr;AXObserverRef observer=nullptr;pid_t pid=0;CFMachPortRef tap=nullptr;CFRunLoopSourceRef source=nullptr;QTimer timeout;QPointF relative;QRect host;bool destroyed=false;
    EventHandlerRef handler=nullptr;EventHotKeyRef keys[2]{};MacPlatform* owner=nullptr;
    void clearTarget(){if(observer){CFRunLoopRemoveSource(CFRunLoopGetMain(),AXObserverGetRunLoopSource(observer),kCFRunLoopCommonModes);CFRelease(observer);observer=nullptr;}if(target){CFRelease(target);target=nullptr;}pid=0;destroyed=false;}
};
MacPlatform::MacPlatform():native_(std::make_unique<Native>()){native_->owner=this;native_->timeout.setSingleShot(true);connect(&native_->timeout,&QTimer::timeout,this,&MacPlatform::cancelSelection);}
MacPlatform::~MacPlatform(){cancelSelection();native_->clearTarget();for(auto key:native_->keys)if(key)UnregisterEventHotKey(key);if(native_->handler)RemoveEventHandler(native_->handler);}
void MacPlatform::initialize(QWindow* w){window_=w;NSView* view=(__bridge NSView*)reinterpret_cast<void*>(w->winId());native_->window=view.window;native_->window.opaque=NO;native_->window.backgroundColor=NSColor.clearColor;native_->window.hasShadow=NO;native_->window.level=NSFloatingWindowLevel;native_->window.collectionBehavior=NSWindowCollectionBehaviorCanJoinAllSpaces|NSWindowCollectionBehaviorFullScreenAuxiliary;native_->effect=[[NSVisualEffectView alloc]initWithFrame:view.bounds];native_->effect.autoresizingMask=NSViewWidthSizable|NSViewHeightSizable;native_->effect.blendingMode=NSVisualEffectBlendingModeBehindWindow;native_->effect.material=NSVisualEffectMaterialHUDWindow;native_->effect.state=NSVisualEffectStateActive;[view addSubview:native_->effect positioned:NSWindowBelow relativeTo:nil];}
Capabilities MacPlatform::capabilities()const{return {{"Monitoring",{"unverified","Native Mach CPU/RAM and Metal adapter discovery; aggregate GPU/temperature readings unavailable until a validated provider exists"}},{"Attachment",{AXIsProcessTrusted()?"unverified":"permission-required","Experimental Accessibility integration requires permission and GLASSSTATS_EXPERIMENTAL_WINDOWING=1; overlap/client-area validation pending"}},{"Adaptive text",{CGPreflightScreenCaptureAccess()?"unverified":"permission-required","ScreenCaptureKit requires Screen Recording permission and GLASSSTATS_EXPERIMENTAL_CAPTURE=1; otherwise glyph halo fallback"}},{"Global shortcuts",{"unverified","Native hotkey registration; verify on actual Mac hardware"}},{"Backdrop",{"unverified","NSVisualEffectView native material; visual validation pending"}}};}
QString MacPlatform::backdropDescription()const{return "macOS native visual-effect material (unverified on hardware)";}
void MacPlatform::setLocked(bool value){locked_=value;native_->window.ignoresMouseEvents=value;emit changed();}
void MacPlatform::setUserVisible(bool v){userVisible_=v;if(v&&!selecting_)[native_->window orderFrontRegardless];else[native_->window orderOut:nil];if(attached_)reconcile();emit changed();}
